我想我们可能有个共同朋友之类的。

362
00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:14.840
And he just kind of reached across the water and, you know, threw me a life raft and was like, come into this conversation.
他就像隔着水面伸出援手，抛给我一个救生圈，邀请我加入谈话。

363
00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.080
